{
  "format": "story-pages-v1",
  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukongs-wibble-wobble-ride-v3.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "6fde18f8e5d81600217798c64b2c24525d3080559ea59b16a938586f1a728f7b",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c59f61cd0cf5e3888d6c8af51bb4dfa7cbb4307510b483e1b8a532afc258a389",
      "text": "Wukong’s\nWibble-Wobble\nRide",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f6b7e7454287717e98edbbae97853132e74a4f71ab289c8c6bdd6ba9bb2db41f",
      "text": "“Look at them go!”\nWukong’s tail went BOING!\n“I want to ride, too!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "556eb576dee16a4d790bc1b820d32cf32de66d80b508b12f6ce177d5ed4736c6",
      "text": "Wukong put on his helmet.\n“Ready!”\n“Um… it’s backward!”\nWukong giggled.\n“Let’s try again!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "59bb299e6cd6f81c00cea33c48760f9890df0090d4376da98fb5cd64707c99f9",
      "text": "He pushed with his feet.\nScoot. Scoot. Scoot.\n“Look! A monkey scooter!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "16ef3137781b1c894ee1add2076f70d4b266c7c01506497d902ab7be36ab2570",
      "text": "Feet up…\nWibble! Wobble!\nPLOP!\n“Hello, grass.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "22ca7605d97b9f2a091ea210e3543c34dfd3bdd0c48437d79f748205937a7ec5",
      "text": "“Maybe the bell will help.”\nDing! Ding!\nThe bell worked.\nThe wobble stayed.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7785e5dc76aebc2096c3ac9a09499d98fe04dd315d6545649e0b19a76e5f63e2",
      "text": "Pigsy held the seat.\n“Eyes ahead. Nice and slow.”\nRabbit cheered.\n“You can do it!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "47c30a3ada96f3e629be07ae6ebf79324249c5a47634a69a971e46cfa30d67c5",
      "text": "Wukong tried again.\nOne push.\nOne pedal.\nTwo.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ff25b54cac6656a49509f92b5c495fd5ba34db772addb65a854e28a8174f30b7",
      "text": "He wobbled left.\nHis tail wobbled right.\n“My tail is learning, too!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5bab80f3a33a8bdc6fc1abc72335ae648884fdb36329193921c6453511445878",
      "text": "He tried a little every day.\nSome rides were short.\nSome were wobbly.\nHe kept trying.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "097b84639b7205f702362715d608dee990664089216a2b1b14644cd610101ea8",
      "text": "Then, one evening…\nPigsy let go.\nWukong kept going!",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9c2479132256879979a555b1cba5c83cf91b67a480dfe13213fdb9262d9dc60d",
      "text": "“I’m doing it!”\nHis scarf fluttered.\nHis tail made a loop.\nEven his ears felt proud.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "95b2f32ae2faa9f27ee625bd941d30c03ea12d1ed66777acec6bd18f3c95cb56",
      "text": "He learned to turn.\nHe learned to stop.\nJust before a puddle.\n“After you, little duck.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "032ba011b8b9a38c602297b7a526fe6d866f03bcb5abb2f05d8f943886b638bf",
      "text": "Now they rode together.\nNo rush.\nJust happy wheels.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c63dcdff8d32e5a2b90cde45a76441b4843b81a1646a49aad2cca9d0279d36db",
      "text": "At home, he parked his bike.\n“Goodnight, wheels.”\n“Goodnight, wobbles.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b2cffd13126e5fbd4df647cfbf0ee71edc3d64372e21f8ef6c8507e111c59615",
      "text": "Wukong curled up in bed.\nIn his dreams,\nthe path was smooth.\nAnd the wheels whispered,\n“Shhh…”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6b94c8febe5feb6a7e982144d0c240be01010efc5f336537724b56e5cfcd50ae",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.",
